}</style><div class="news-card"> <a href="/az/news/bushra-nur-durmaz-at-western-caspian-university" class="news-link"> <div class="news-image"> <img src="/uploads/newsImg/img_6a0415839effc.jpg" alt="News Image"> <div class="news-date-badge"> <span class="day">13</span> <span class="month">May</span> </div> </div> <div class="news-content"> <h2 class="news-title"> B&uuml;şra Nur Durmaz Qərbi Kaspi Universitetində </h2> <p class="news-description"> </p> </div> </a></div><div class="news-card"> <a href="/az/news/qerbi-kaspi-universitetinde-xaqani-shirvani-yaradiciligina-h" class="news-link"> <div class="news-image"> <img src="/uploads/newsImg/img_6a02d849b2845.jpeg" alt="News Image"> <div class="news-date-badge"> <span class="day">12</span> <span class="month">May</span> </div> </div> <div class="news-content"> <h2 class="news-title"> Qərbi Kaspi Universitetində Xaqani Şirvani yaradıcılığına həsr olunmuş m&uuml;hazirə ke&ccedil;irilib </h2> <p class="news-description"> </p> </div> </a></div><div class="news-card"> <a href="/az/news/qerbi-kaspi-universitetinin-ugurlari-olkenin-aparici-media-p" class="news-link"> <div class="news-image"> <img src="/uploads/newsImg/img_6a0313492aa92.jpg" alt="News Image"> <div class="news-date-badge"> <span class="day">12</span> <span class="month">May</span> </div> </div> <div class="news-content"> <h2 class="news-title"> Qərbi Kaspi Universitetinin uğurları &ouml;lkənin aparıcı media platformalarında </h2> <p class="news-description"> </p> </div> </a></div><div class="news-card"> <a href="/az/news/dosgokhan-kirbach-qerbi-kaspi-universitetinde" class="news-link"> <div class="news-image"> <img src="/uploads/newsImg/img_6a041628b8ea7.jpg" alt="News Image"> <div class="news-date-badge"> <span class="day">12</span> <span class="month">May</span> </div> </div> <div class="news-content"> <h2 class="news-title"> Dos.G&ouml;khan Kırba&ccedil; Qərbi Kaspi Universitetində </h2> <p class="news-description"> </p> </div> </a></div><div class="news-card"> <a href="/az/news/qerbi-kaspi-universitetinin-professoru-beynelxalq-konfransda" class="news-link"> <div class="news-image"> <img src="/uploads/newsImg/img_6a02d08dc9235.jpeg" alt="News Image"> <div class="news-date-badge"> <span class="day">11</span> <span class="month">May</span> </div> </div> <div class="news-content"> <h2 class="news-title"> Qərbi Kaspi Universitetinin professoru beynəlxalq konfransda əsas məruzə&ccedil;i kimi &ccedil;ıxış edib </h2> <p class="news-description"> </p> </div> </a></div><div class="news-card"> <a href="/az/news/xor-kollektivi-heyder-eliyev-sarayinda-chixish-edib" class="news-link"> <div class="news-image"> <img src="/uploads/newsImg/img_6a02d06f7a54d.jpeg" alt="News Image"> <div class="news-date-badge"> <span class="day">10</span> <span class="month">May</span> </div> </div> <div class="news-content"> <h2 class="news-title"> Xor kollektivi Heydər Əliyev Sarayında &ccedil;ıxış edib&nbsp; </h2> <p class="news-description"> </p> </div> </a></div><div class="news-card"> <a href="/az/news/umummilli-lider-heyder-eliyevin-anadan-olmasinin-illiyine-he" class="news-link"> <div class="news-image"> <img src="/uploads/newsImg/img_6a02c9d6a2d25.jpeg" alt="News Image"> <div class="news-date-badge"> <span class="day">09</span> <span class="month">May</span> </div> </div> <div class="news-content"> <h2 class="news-title"> &Uuml;mummilli Lider Heydər Əliyevin anadan olmasının 103 illiyinə həsr olunmuş sərgi ke&ccedil;irilib </h2> <p class="news-description"> </p> </div> </a></div><div class="news-card"> <a href="/az/news/azerbaycan-dili-uzre-hazirliq-kursunda-tehsil-alan-ecnebi-te" class="news-link"> <div class="news-image"> <img src="/uploads/newsImg/img_6a02c95c50fb8.jpeg" alt="News Image"> <div class="news-date-badge"> <span class="day">08</span> <span class="month">May</span> </div> </div> <div class="news-content"> <h2 class="news-title"> QKU: Azərbaycan dili &uuml;zrə Hazırlıq kursunda təhsil alan əcnəbi tələbələr proqramı uğurla başa vur